# Excel to CSV Converter using Qt5

Here's a complete Qt5 application that converts Excel files to CSV format.

## Project Structure

```
excel_to_csv/
├── CMakeLists.txt
├── main.cpp
├── mainwindow.h
├── mainwindow.cpp
└── excelconverter.h
└── excelconverter.cpp
```

## CMakeLists.txt

```cmake
cmake_minimum_required(VERSION 3.14)
project(ExcelToCSVConverter LANGUAGES CXX)

set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD 17)
set(CMAKE_CXX_STANDARD_REQUIRED ON)
set(CMAKE_AUTOMOC ON)
set(CMAKE_AUTORCC ON)
set(CMAKE_AUTOUIC ON)

find_package(Qt5 REQUIRED COMPONENTS Core Widgets Gui)

# For Excel reading, we'll use QXlsx library
# You can install it or include it as a subdirectory
find_package(QXlsx QUIET)

add_executable(ExcelToCSVConverter
    main.cpp
    mainwindow.cpp
    mainwindow.h
    excelconverter.cpp
    excelconverter.h
)

target_link_libraries(ExcelToCSVConverter PRIVATE
    Qt5::Core
    Qt5::Widgets
    Qt5::Gui
    QXlsx::QXlsx
)
```

## main.cpp

```cpp
#include <QApplication>
#include "mainwindow.h"

int main(int argc, char *argv[])
{
    QApplication app(argc, argv);
    app.setApplicationName("Excel to CSV Converter");
    app.setApplicationVersion("1.0");

    MainWindow window;
    window.show();

    return app.exec();
}
```

